  "onboarding.title": "Serbest Gruplar'a ho\u015F geldin",
  "onboarding.body": "Gruplar, \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma alan\u0131 kenar \xE7ubu\u011Funun \xFCzerine eklenen bir katmand\u0131r. Bir oturumu gruba atamak, \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma alan\u0131 \xFCyeli\u011Fini veya g\xFCnl\xFC\u011F\xFCn\xFC de\u011Fi\u015Ftirmez; yaln\u0131zca oturumun Serbest Gruplar g\xF6r\xFCn\xFCm\xFCnde nerede g\xF6r\xFCnece\u011Fini de\u011Fi\u015Ftirir. Oturumlar\u0131 gruplara s\xFCr\xFCkle; grup ba\u015Fl\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 s\xFCr\xFCkleyerek s\u0131ralar\u0131n\u0131 de\u011Fi\u015Ftir veya i\xE7 i\xE7e yerle\u015Ftir.",
